WEBVTT

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.290
And here we are.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.500
That was great!

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.280
Gondolas are the best!

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:16.620
Akari!

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:20.450
Big news! It's a miracle!

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.920
Ai, I've got customers...

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.870
Oh! I'm sorry.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:27.700
Thank you for your patronage. Please, take my hand.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:31.060
Thank you. So did something good happen?

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:35.440
Yes, something very good.
This city is overflowing with miracles!

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:36.930
I know, right?

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:40.430
I hope a miracle will happen to us one day!

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:44.530
That's why we're gonna be walking all over town tomorrow.

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:47.020
Thanks for the tour!

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:49.160
Thank you for your patronage!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.230
So what do you wanna eat?

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.830
I was thinking sandwiches.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.200
Okay, sounds good!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.050
You were saying something about a miracle?

00:00:57.050 --> 00:00:58.780
Oh, right!

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:04.490
Listen, Akari! It's incredible! It's a miracle!

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:06.130
Wow, what could it be?

00:01:06.130 --> 00:01:07.870
Right, President Aria?

00:01:08.740 --> 00:01:11.040
Well, looks like someone's excited.

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:14.990
Of course he is. It was just that fantastic!

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:20.370
I might have found a secret entrance to Aqua's miracles!

00:01:20.370 --> 00:01:23.330
Oh, really? What happened?

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:39.230
Hello!

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:42.500
Hey! Looks like you're really starting to get the hang of it!

00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.990
Really?

00:01:43.990 --> 00:01:45.200
Keep up the good work!

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:46.810
Thank you!

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.680
You be sure to work hard, too!

00:01:49.680 --> 00:01:50.630
Sure thing!

00:01:55.410 --> 00:01:59.140
Today's going to be a good day.

00:02:00.130 --> 00:02:03.380
Wait, no! I shouldn't get carried away!

00:02:03.380 --> 00:02:05.200
Focus, Ai, focus.

00:02:20.940 --> 00:02:24.540
Has there always been an alley here?

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:31.710
A cat...?

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:37.760
No, that was Cait Sith!

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:53.000
Softly, through the window

00:02:54.670 --> 00:03:00.610
The rays of the morning sun come stretching in

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:13.660
Overflowing past your sleepy eyelashes

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:28.780
As you invite the gentle breeze into your room

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:36.170
Leaf-dappled sunlight shines on your sleeping face

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:41.370
Tender euphoria

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:47.970
Although it's an ordinary morning,

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:55.460
It's vivid and brightly colored

00:03:55.460 --> 00:04:03.150
That is the miracle of our chance encounter

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:06.750
I'm not alone,

00:04:06.750 --> 00:04:13.310
Because I'm with you

00:04:22.860 --> 00:04:26.870
That Warm Goodbye...

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:30.040
Where is this?

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:36.290
I had no idea that alley led to a place like this.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.480
Did you know, President Aria?

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.110
No dice. I think we've lost it.

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:59.440
That cat must have some serious talent, avoiding both of us.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:04.490
Are you looking for Cait Sith?

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.660
What? Where'd that come from?

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:11.160
Oh, you're the new girl at Aria Company.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:15.120
Wait, you're...

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:27.860
I'm Azusa B. McLaren. The manager of one of Himeya's branches is teaching me.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:31.390
Not to toot my own horn here, but I'm a diamond in the rough!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:37.230
Anya Dostoevskaya. Alice is helping me at Orange Planet.

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.980
I'm Ai Aino.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.610
We know.

00:05:42.460 --> 00:05:43.900
You do?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:48.900
You're an apprentice at Grandma's famous Aria Company.

00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.100
That's enough to make people want to look into you.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:56.380
Yeah. If an apprentice is weird enough, they get Siberia duty.

00:05:57.410 --> 00:05:59.520
Wait, where's Siberia?

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.680
I don't know, actually.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:04.800
So how did you investigate me?

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.470
With your data at the Gondola Association.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:09.120
Oh.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:14.720
And according to the manager,
you used to give people tours for free.

00:06:15.540 --> 00:06:19.890
But you changed because of Aria Company's downright miraculous powers.

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:22.610
Um, weren't you looking for a cat?

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:27.610
Yeah, there's been rumors of a blue-eyed cat lurking around here.

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:31.220
Himeya's main store needs a new president.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:32.370
Oh, I see.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:37.170
And you were looking for Cait Sith?

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:39.210
Yeah, right!

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:46.640
I only heard this from Alice, but is it true that you run into a lot of miracles, just like Akari?

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:49.220
Because if so...

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:52.520
I'm pretty sure I saw his shadow a little while ago.

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:56.850
It made me happy, so I followed it, and that's how I wound up here.

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.140
Wait, now that I think about it, that sounds really weird...

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:02.530
I knew it! Bullseye!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:06.840
We'll help you look!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:07.670
Right?

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.950
Yes, absolutely.

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.640
My manager talks about this kind of thing often.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:15.950
This is my chance to see a super-powerful miracle!

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:19.660
This wondrous adventure is quite exciting.

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:22.400
Nothing here.

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:25.150
Let's try looking over here again.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.880
Seriously?

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:28.320
Wait up...

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:37.770
My legs are killing me.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.710
Don't you dreamers know the word "rest?"

00:07:41.710 --> 00:07:43.060
Sorry...

00:07:43.430 --> 00:07:45.280
A dreamer, through and through.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:46.590
Fearsome indeed.

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.980
How about we get some tea?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:50.720
I'm in! Let's go!

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:51.900
Finally...

00:07:54.430 --> 00:07:56.610
Here's your straw, President Aria.

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:03.060
Whew, I needed this.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:07.490
You know, Azusa, we've barely practiced at all today.

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.600
Won't Aika get mad at you?

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:16.430
W-well, I've been looking for a new president, so I should probably be fine...

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.530
But we were looking for Cait Sith, not a cat.

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:19.730
Uh...

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:22.870
Unlike Alice, Aika is really harsh.

00:08:22.870 --> 00:08:25.080
You might have some serious punishment waiting for you.

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.640
Shoot, this could get ugly...

00:08:27.640 --> 00:08:32.000
Do you two practice together?

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.390
Yeah.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.660
Usually, yes.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.540
U-Um, can I join you?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:41.580
Please?

00:08:44.370 --> 00:08:45.680
Of course!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:55.780
Don't you think this is a miracle from Cait Sith?

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:58.030
Yeah, it has to be!

00:08:58.030 --> 00:08:59.800
Right?

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:03.040
Cait Sith...

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:06.770
He must still be watching over you from somewhere.

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:11.780
Oh yeah, did you ever get to see him again?

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:21.550
Nope, that was the last time.

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.670
Cait Sith?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.760
Yeah, I haven't seen him at all lately.

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:35.470
That's really unfortunate.

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:40.100
Maybe you never will.

00:09:43.420 --> 00:09:49.310
We want to be Primas, which means we'd be real adults, right?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:55.750
So we'd be graduating from the world only kids can see.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:04.730
Then I wish I could just see him one last time.

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:16.210
Wait, just maybe...

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:24.250
Let's give it a shot.

00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:30.760
Right over there.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:35.280
One of the seven wonders of Neo-Venezia, the Stone of Misfortune.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:36.970
What does it do?

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:39.210
I've heard of it.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:44.580
It's a replica of a famous stone from the Venice on Manhome.

00:10:46.490 --> 00:10:48.430
People are walking around it.

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:51.540
Yeah, rumor has it that bad things happen to you if you step on it.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:53.400
Bad things? Like what?

00:10:53.400 --> 00:10:56.570
I don't know. Just bad things.

00:10:56.570 --> 00:10:58.530
Sounds creepy.

00:10:58.530 --> 00:10:59.930
And now, I'm off!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:01.510
What are you doing?

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:02.650
Hi-yah!

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:06.540
She stepped on...

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.720
The Stone of Misfortune!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:10.730
What are you thinking, you kid?!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:13.500
Nothing's happening.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:16.530
I was hoping something would, but oh well.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:20.060
It's okay, I stepped on it all the time when I was little.

00:11:20.060 --> 00:11:22.200
Nothing ever happened.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:24.860
Oh. Geez, don't scare us like that!

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:28.400
But I thought maybe something might happen if I was with Akari.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:30.210
No scary experiments allowed!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.240
It's this late already?

00:11:35.240 --> 00:11:38.740
Aika, aren't you supposed to be teaching some juniors today?

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.620
Wha-! I forgot!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:43.010
And I have school.

00:11:43.010 --> 00:11:44.240
See you later.

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:45.400
Bye.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:47.800
Bye. Have fun.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:54.390
Well, we should start heading back to the company.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:03.540
The Stone of Misfortune,
one of the seven wonders of Neo-Venezia...

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:19.640
I'll try stepping on it.

00:12:21.010 --> 00:12:24.470
Maybe I'll get to see Cait Sith.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:41.650
Well...

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:44.490
here goes!

00:13:06.220 --> 00:13:10.010
Doesn't look like anything's happening, huh, President Aria?

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:18.380
I guess I just can't see Cait Sith anymore.

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:24.900
That's... a shame.

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:05.150
I'm so happy!

00:14:05.430 --> 00:14:07.190
I can finally see you again!

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.820
I've been looking for you forever.

00:14:10.820 --> 00:14:14.910
I'm so glad I can see you!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:26.130
Next time, I'll come to you, okay?

00:14:27.110 --> 00:14:29.690
Where do I have to go to find you?

00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.370
Should I just step on that stone?

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:42.840
Is this the last time I can see you?

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:47.130
I don't want that!

00:14:59.630 --> 00:15:01.170
Are you saying...

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:31.320
I'll never forget you, as long as I live.

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:45.710
You'll always be right here with me, right?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.300
President Aria...

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.810
It's so pretty.

00:16:55.810 --> 00:16:56.770
Yeah.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:02.290
Maybe the light in it is a miracle,

00:17:02.650 --> 00:17:05.810
and that's why it's so shiny.

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:10.710
Yeah, I bet it is.

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:18.460
Your miracle today was shiny, too.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:24.060
The three of us are gonna practice hard and be Prima Undines one day.

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:28.880
But I want to meet Cait Sith sometime, too.

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:35.080
Sooner or later, you have to say goodbye to everyone you meet.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:43.120
But even though I said goodbye to Cait Sith that day,
I think Ai has helped me see him again.

00:17:44.020 --> 00:17:50.140
Maybe love is what calls forth miracles.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:01.910
I make a wish

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:12.870
To the clouds vanishing beyond the calm blue

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:17.210
Hoping for a new day to dawn on us

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:25.680
Now, let's be on our way

00:18:26.140 --> 00:18:31.270
It's time for our journey to begin

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:43.780
Let's set sail together

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:52.290
And little by little, head toward our goal

00:18:52.290 --> 00:19:02.720
I realized that you always watched over me

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:12.730
Though you might not be by my side anymore

00:19:12.730 --> 00:19:26.660
You taught me what happiness means

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:33.410
I will never forget that

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:45.970
And these feelings will shine eternal
